<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Western Metals to develop lead/zinc.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Western Metals to develop lead/zinc.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Metals Ltd said on Thursday its board had approved the development of the Kapok zinc/lead mine in the far north of Western Australia.</p>
<p>&quot;The Kapok mine is expected to come on stream in April/May, although the exact timing and the level of production will depend on the life of the Cadjebut mine which it replaces,&quot; Western Metals said.</p>
</text>
